#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Rock Raiders, from its boot through the level select into its first
# mission, playing.
#
# The boot and the level select are level-select.route's. At flip 4700 the
# pointer moves onto the one open cavern, top left, and clicks it. The title
# loads the mission with its loading screen up, and by flip 4800 puts up the
# Mission Brief over the level, which is drawn in 3D behind it, turning to
# its second page by itself. Space at 5300 and again at 5400; by 5450 the
# brief is gone, its Red Book audio is playing, and the tutorial's first
# instruction waits over the level while its raiders walk.
flip 4610 move 320 222
flip 4620 down
flip 4622 up
flip 4700 move 155 160
flip 4710 down
flip 4712 up
flip 5300 key Space down
flip 5302 key Space up
flip 5400 key Space down
flip 5402 key Space up
